<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-581] Dynamic form with default value returns empty string at first run</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-581</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce:&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;#8211;&lt;br/&gt;
1. create a new paragraph&lt;br/&gt;
2. type in code:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;val selected = z.select(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;formName&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;option1&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, Seq((&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;option1&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;option1DisplayName&quot;&lt;/span&gt;), (&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;option2&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;option2DisplayName&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)))
println(selected)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3. Shift + Enter returns empty string &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;res25: &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Object&lt;/span&gt; = &quot;&quot;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4. run again, returns the correct value &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;res27: &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Object&lt;/span&gt; = option1&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
